"""Agent collaboration endpoints (ADR-0027).

The coordinator is the public entry. ``POST /runs`` persists the run and
starts its single worker; streams replay the durable event log from
``Last-Event-ID`` and tail it until the terminal event, so reconnects and
concurrent readers never re-execute a run.
"""

